WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:05.300
Before the music, animals raided the fields more often, wild boar above all.

00:05.500 --> 00:11.100
Now, with the music, they stay away.

00:11.400 --> 00:15.800
The plants look more alive, too.

00:15.900 --> 00:21.300
They no longer seem to crave fertilizer and water. They look fresher, lovelier.
